= Research Methods Seminar
Master and PhD · 1 credit

~~~
{Course information}
- *Level*: Master and PhD \M *Semester*: Every semester \M *Credits*: 1

*What you will learn:* how to read a paper critically, how to write a technical report, how to
give a seminar talk, and how to use Git and LaTeX for your thesis.
~~~

